    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Earnest are delighted to bring No. 4 Clonee Court, a large 1 bedroom apartment c55sqm, to the market. Ideally positioned in this small and highly sought-after development just off the main road in Clonee Village, this well-presented ground floor, dual-aspect apartment offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout and is sure to appeal to first-time buyers and downsizers. \r\n\r\nA particular feature of the property is that it is not overlooked to either the front or rear, offering a good degree of privacy. The property also benefits from designated parking.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a private own-door entrance leading into a welcoming entrance hall, which opens into a spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen area. The room features a cast-iron mantelpiece with a functional fireplace, electric heating, fitted wall and floor kitchen units, and attractive decorative coving.\r\n\r\nThe generously sized bedroom is located further along the hallway and benefits from built-in wardrobes, laminate flooring and electric heating.\r\n\r\nThe bathroom is partially tiled and features a vanity unit and wall-mounted mirror . A large window provides excellent natural light and ventilation. There is also a useful storage area/hot press off the hallway.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a communal parking space and well maintained grounds with mature trees further enhance the attractive setting.\r\n\r\nNo. 4 Clonee Court is an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-presented apartment in a quiet and convenient development, while still being within easy reach of the amenities and services of Clonee Village.\r\n\r\n\r\nLocation : \r\n\r\nIdeally situated tucked off the main street in Clonee village making it convenient to walk to local amenities including the Aldi and Lidl supermarkets.\r\nEasy access to main roads such as N3 and M50.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is advised !!!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION :\r\n\r\nPorch entrance hall , 1.6m x 1.25m : Tiled flooring , ceiling coving \r\n\r\nLiving/ dining / kitchen, 4.85m x 5.35m : Large open living area comes with laminate floors, large window , cast iron fireplace - functional, ceiling coving ,  electric heater ; kitchen has tiled flooring , wall and floor cabinets \r\n\r\nHallway, 2.50m x 1.35m \r\n\r\nBedroom , 3.20m x 3.55m : laminate flooring, built in wardrobes \r\n\r\nBathroom , 2.10m x 2.55m , Partially tiled , vanity unit and mirror , large window for ventilation and natural light \r\n\r\nStorage , 1.50m x 1.1m : comprise hot press and good storage area"
      },
